• The experiment will be done in dedicated bicycle paths which ensures that safe
    distance from participants will be maintained and there will be no risks such as
    overtaking or sudden stoppage.
• The dedicated bike paths have separate signals for bicycle riders which prevent the
    risk of accidents.
• In the planning of experiment there is a 10 minute of break after every two blocks (1
    break in green and 1 break in urban areas) during which they must walk and ride a
    bike. This break time is always available to participants upon request.

